        "title": "Cendara University Co-Curricular and Extra-Curricular Activities",
        "level": 1,
        "location": {
          "line": 1
        },
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 3,
              "heading": "Cendara University Co-Curricular and Extra-Curricular Activities"
            },
            "text": "Cendara University is home to a vibrant array of student clubs and organizations, providing opportunities for leadership, creativity, community involvement, and personal growth. The Office of Student Life supports more than 40 active organizations spanning academic interests, cultural groups, community service, arts, sports, and more. Below is an overview of featured clubs and related activities for the 2023–2024 academic year."
          }
        ],
