                  "line": 138,
                  "heading": "How to Join a Club"
                },
                "text": "Interested students can sign up via the Office of Student Life portal or at the Club Fair. Most clubs welcome new members year-round. For details, contact studentlife@cendara.edu or visit the Student Center Room 102."
